Chr3	Araport11	gene	2124155	2126156	.	+	.	ID=AT3G06730;Name=AT3G06730;Note=Thioredoxin z;curator_summary=Encodes a plastidial thioredoxin (TRX) isoform that defines a branch of plastidial TRXs lying between x- and y-type TRXs and thus was named TRX z. Possesses disulfide reductase activity in vitro. TRX z was previously named as Trx p (thioredoxin putative and plastidic) before its thioredoxin activity was confirmed (Meng et al.%2C PNAS 2010%2C 107:3900). Knockout mutant of TRX z has a severe albino phenotype and is inhibited in chloroplast development. Two fructokinase-like proteins (FLN1 and FLN2)%2C members of the pfkB-carbohydrate kinase family%2C are potential TRX z targets.;symbol=TRX z;Alias=TRX P,thioredoxin putative plastidic;full_name=Thioredoxin z;computational_description=Thioredoxin z (TRX z)%3B FUNCTIONS IN: protein-disulfide reductase activity%2C protein disulfide oxidoreductase activity%3B INVOLVED IN: plastid organization%2C cell redox homeostasis%3B LOCATED IN: thylakoid%2C chloroplast%2C nucleoid%3B EXPRESSED IN: 22 plant structures%3B EXPRESSED DURING: 13 growth stages%3B CONTAINS InterPro DOMAIN/s: Thioredoxin fold (InterPro:IPR012335)%2C Thioredoxin-like subdomain (InterPro:IPR006662)%2C Thioredoxin%2C core (InterPro:IPR015467)%2C Thioredoxin-like (InterPro:IPR017936)%2C Thioredoxin domain (InterPro:IPR013766)%2C Thioredoxin-like fold (InterPro:IPR012336)%3B BEST Arabidopsis thaliana protein match is: thioredoxin Y2 (TAIR:AT1G43560.1)%3B Has 15064 Blast hits to 14650 proteins in 2900 species: Archae - 204%3B Bacteria - 8491%3B Metazoa - 1613%3B Fungi - 754%3B Plants - 1355%3B Viruses - 0%3B Other Eukaryotes - 2647 (source: NCBI BLink).;Dbxref=PMID:14576160,PMID:15937229,PMID:16326926,PMID:17031546,PMID:18650403,PMID:20133584,PMID:20511297,PMID:20511298,PMID:21949211,PMID:23956074,PMID:24019900,PMID:24659486,locus:2083398;locus_type=protein_coding
