Chr3	Araport11	gene	2178630	2181341	.	-	.	ID=AT3G06910;Name=AT3G06910;Note=UB-like protease 1A;curator_summary=Encodes a deSUMOylating enzyme. In vitro it has both peptidase activity and isopeptidase activity: it can cleave the C-terminal residues from SUMO to activate it for attachment to a target protein and it can also act on the isopeptide bond between SUMO and another protein. In vitro assays suggest that this enzyme is active against SUMO1 and SUMO2. It has weak activity with SUMO3 and cannot act on SUMO5. The N-terminal regulatory region of this protein is required for full activity.;symbol=ULP1A;Alias=AtULP1a,ELS1,ESD4-LIKE SUMO PROTEASE 1;full_name=UB-like protease 1A;computational_description=UB-like protease 1A (ULP1A)%3B CONTAINS InterPro DOMAIN/s: Peptidase C48%2C SUMO/Sentrin/Ubl1 (InterPro:IPR003653)%3B BEST Arabidopsis thaliana protein match is: Cysteine proteinases superfamily protein (TAIR:AT4G15880.1)%3B Has 1394 Blast hits to 1393 proteins in 209 species: Archae - 0%3B Bacteria - 2%3B Metazoa - 593%3B Fungi - 272%3B Plants - 373%3B Viruses - 5%3B Other Eukaryotes - 149 (source: NCBI BLink).;Dbxref=PMID:12482876,PMID:14507998,PMID:16581939,PMID:18650403,PMID:16740136,PMID:20922545,locus:2077632;locus_type=protein_coding
