Chr3	Araport11	gene	4303822	4310275	.	+	.	ID=AT3G13300;Name=AT3G13300;Note=Transducin/WD40 repeat-like superfamily protein;curator_summary=Encodes VCS (VARICOSE).   Involved in mRNA decapping.  VCS forms a mRNA decapping complex with DCP1 (At1g08370) and DCP2 (At5g13570).  Unlike DCP2%2C VCS itself does not have mRNA decapping activity in vitro.  DCP1%2C DCP2 and VCS colocalize in cytoplasmic loci%2C which are putative Arabidopsis mRNA processing bodies.  Null mutants of DCP1%2C DCP2%2C and VCS accumulate capped mRNAs with a reduced degradation rate. These mutants also share a similar lethal phenotype at the seedling cotyledon stage%2C with disorganized veins%2C swollen root hairs%2C and altered epidermal cell morphology.  VCS is also required for leaf development.;symbol=VCS;full_name=VARICOSE;computational_description=VARICOSE (VCS)%3B FUNCTIONS IN: protein homodimerization activity%2C nucleotide binding%3B INVOLVED IN: mRNA catabolic process%2C deadenylation-independent decapping of nuclear-transcribed mRNA%2C leaf morphogenesis%3B LOCATED IN: cytosol%2C nucleus%2C cytoplasmic mRNA processing body%3B EXPRESSED IN: whole plant%2C guard cell%2C cultured cell%3B CONTAINS InterPro DOMAIN/s: WD40 repeat-like-containing domain (InterPro:IPR011046)%2C WD40 repeat 2 (InterPro:IPR019782)%2C WD40-repeat-containing domain (InterPro:IPR017986)%2C WD40 repeat (InterPro:IPR001680)%2C WD40/YVTN repeat-like-containing domain (InterPro:IPR015943)%2C WD40 repeat%2C subgroup (InterPro:IPR019781)%3B BEST Arabidopsis thaliana protein match is: varicose-related (TAIR:AT3G13290.1)%3B Has 1013 Blast hits to 919 proteins in 280 species: Archae - 4%3B Bacteria - 227%3B Metazoa - 270%3B Fungi - 225%3B Plants - 138%3B Viruses - 6%3B Other Eukaryotes - 143 (source: NCBI BLink).;Dbxref=PMID:14660546,PMID:15341630,PMID:17158604,PMID:17513503,PMID:18433157,PMID:18650403,PMID:19855049,PMID:20798041,PMID:22614834,locus:2088165;locus_type=protein_coding
