Chr3	Araport11	gene	7906521	7908746	.	+	.	ID=AT3G22370;Name=AT3G22370;Note=alternative oxidase 1A;curator_summary=Encodes AOX1a%2C an isoform of alternative oxidase that is expressed in rosettes%2C flowers%2C and root. The alternative oxidase of plant mitochondria transfers electrons from the ubiquinone pool to oxygen without energy conservations.  It is regulated through transcriptional control and by pyruvate.  Plays a role in shoot acclimation to low temperature.  Also is capable of ameliorating reactive oxygen species production when the cytochrome pathway is inhibited.  AOX1a also functions as a marker for mitochondrial retrograde response.;symbol=AOX1A;Alias=ATAOX1A,AtHSR3,HSR3,hyper-sensitivity-related 3;full_name=alternative oxidase 1A;computational_description=alternative oxidase 1A (AOX1A)%3B FUNCTIONS IN: alternative oxidase activity%3B INVOLVED IN: oxidation reduction%2C cellular respiration%2C response to cold%2C response to stress%2C mitochondria-nucleus signaling pathway%3B LOCATED IN: mitochondrion%3B EXPRESSED IN: 26 plant structures%3B EXPRESSED DURING: 14 growth stages%3B CONTAINS InterPro DOMAIN/s: Alternative oxidase (InterPro:IPR002680)%3B BEST Arabidopsis thaliana protein match is: alternative oxidase 1B (TAIR:AT3G22360.1)%3B Has 1299 Blast hits to 1299 proteins in 245 species: Archae - 0%3B Bacteria - 109%3B Metazoa - 12%3B Fungi - 194%3B Plants - 380%3B Viruses - 0%3B Other Eukaryotes - 604 (source: NCBI BLink).;Dbxref=PMID:10518009,PMID:10431811,PMID:9349280,PMID:1438286,PMID:11434463,PMID:11216842,PMID:12034477,PMID:12215444,PMID:12355151,PMID:14671022,PMID:15605175,PMID:15642340,PMID:15689186,PMID:16258072,PMID:16299171,PMID:16299170,PMID:16457775,PMID:16618929,PMID:16859634,PMID:16891546,PMID:17159296,PMID:17507388,PMID:18424626,PMID:18567827,PMID:18650403,PMID:18775970,PMID:19482916,PMID:15952071,PMID:16027974,PMID:16027972,PMID:19567377,PMID:19825614,PMID:19941623,PMID:19897671,PMID:20304787,PMID:20561255,PMID:20801923,PMID:20716069,PM