Chr3	Araport11	gene	9853828	9856212	.	-	.	ID=AT3G26790;Name=AT3G26790;Note=AP2/B3-like transcriptional factor family protein;curator_summary=Transcriptional factor with high similarity to the B3 region of the VP1/ABI3-like proteins. Full length FUS3 protein binds to the highly conserved RY motif [DNA motif CATGCA(TG)]%2C present in many seed-specific promoters%2C and the B3 domains of this transcription factor is necessary for the specific interaction with the RY element. Transcriptional activity of FUS3 requires the B3 DNA-binding domain and an activation domain. FUS3 specifies cotyledon identity. Regulator of gene expression during late embryogenesis. Involved in the control foliar organ identity in Arabidopsis by regulating the synthesis of two hormones%2C abscisic acid and gibberellin.  FUS3 together with LEC1 positively regulate the abundance of the ABI3 protein in the seed.;symbol=FUS3;full_name=FUSCA 3;computational_description=FUSCA 3 (FUS3)%3B CONTAINS InterPro DOMAIN/s: Transcriptional factor B3 (InterPro:IPR003340)%3B BEST Arabidopsis thaliana protein match is: AP2/B3-like transcriptional factor family protein (TAIR:AT3G24650.1)%3B Has 875 Blast hits to 861 proteins in 60 species: Archae - 0%3B Bacteria - 0%3B Metazoa - 1%3B Fungi - 7%3B Plants - 523%3B Viruses - 0%3B Other Eukaryotes - 344 (source: NCBI BLink).;Dbxref=PMID:10948227,PMID:10759505,PMID:10758492,PMID:10753527,PMID:10743655,PMID:10047566,PMID:9807814,PMID:9681014,PMID:9678577,PMID:9286105,PMID:8756606,PMID:11124119,PMID:11118137,PMID:12096096,PMID:12244265,PMID:12244252,PMID:12529517,PMID:12662313,PMID:12834400,PMID:14597573,PMID:14676287,PMID:14675433,PMID:14767767,PMID:15363412,PMID:15695463,PMID:15695450,PMID:15894743,PMID:15862093,PMID:16034595,PMID:16107256,PMID:16731585,PMID:17158584,PMID:17522888,PMID:18047557,PMID:18038114,PMID:18024558,PMID:18086283,PMID:18287041,PMID:18265943,PMID:18343361,PMID:18476867,PMID:19261733,PMID:19767455,PMID:20385809,PMID:20663088,PMID:21045071,PMID:2128