Chr3	Araport11	gene	14093656	14095588	.	-	.	ID=AT3G33520;Name=AT3G33520;Note=actin-related protein 6;curator_summary=Encodes ACTIN-RELATED PROTEIN6 (ARP6)%2C a putative component of a chromatin-remodeling complex. Required for both histone acetylation and methylation of the FLC chromatin in Arabidopsis.  Along with PIE1 forms a complex to deposit modified histone H2A.Z at several loci within the genome. This modification alters the expression of the target genes (i.e. FLC%2C MAF4%2C MAF6).  Incorporation of this variant histone into chromatin mediates the ambient temperature response. Located at specific regions of the nuclear periphery. Expression throughout plants shown by in-situ and immunolocalization methods. Mutants show defects in fertility%2C leaf%2C flower and inflorescence development and shorter flowering times.  ARP6 also is involved in globally controlling developmental responses to ambient temperature through incorporation of variant histone H2A.Z into chromatin.;symbol=ARP6;Alias=ATARP6,actin-related protein 6,ESD1,EARLY IN SHORT DAYS 1,SUF3,SUPPRESSOR OF FRI 3;full_name=actin-related protein 6;computational_description=actin-related protein 6 (ARP6)%3B CONTAINS InterPro DOMAIN/s: Actin/actin-like (InterPro:IPR004000)%3B BEST Arabidopsis thaliana protein match is: actin 3 (TAIR:AT3G53750.1)%3B Has 12358 Blast hits to 12072 proteins in 2463 species: Archae - 0%3B Bacteria - 4%3B Metazoa - 5326%3B Fungi - 3155%3B Plants - 1501%3B Viruses - 2%3B Other Eukaryotes - 2370 (source: NCBI BLink).;Dbxref=PMID:7482765,PMID:11891255,PMID:15063870,PMID:16141450,PMID:16155178,PMID:16495307,PMID:17142478,PMID:17220196,PMID:17470967,PMID:17988222,PMID:19897606,PMID:20079334,PMID:21228632,PMID:24056716,PMID:24067909,PMID:24737671,PMID:25417931,locus:2102202;locus_type=protein_coding
Chr3	Araport11	mRNA	14093656	14095588	.	-	.	ID=AT3G33520.1;Parent=AT3G33520;Name=AT3G33520.1;Note=actin-related protein 6;curator_summary=Encodes ACTIN-RELATED PROTEIN6 (ARP6)%2C a putative component of a chromatin-remodeling complex. Required for both histone acetylation and methylation of the FLC chromatin in Arabidopsis.  Along with PIE1 forms a complex to deposit modified histone H2A.Z at several loci within the genome. This modification alters the expression of the target genes (i.e. FLC%2C MAF4%2C MAF6).  Incorporation of this variant histone into chromatin mediates the ambient temperature response. Located at specific regions of the nuclear periphery. Expression throughout plants shown by in-situ and immunolocalization methods. Mutants show defects in fertility%2C leaf%2C flower and inflorescence development and shorter flowering times.  ARP6 also is involved in globally controlling developmental responses to ambient temperature through incorporation of variant histone H2A.Z into chromatin.;conf_class=2;symbol=ARP6;Alias=ATARP6,actin-related protein 6,ESD1,EARLY IN SHORT DAYS 1,SUF3,SUPPRESSOR OF FRI 3;full_name=actin-related protein 6;computational_description=actin-related protein 6 (ARP6)%3B CONTAINS InterPro DOMAIN/s: Actin/actin-like (InterPro:IPR004000)%3B BEST Arabidopsis thaliana protein match is: actin 3 (TAIR:AT3G53750.1)%3B Has 12358 Blast hits to 12072 proteins in 2463 species: Archae - 0%3B Bacteria - 4%3B Metazoa - 5326%3B Fungi - 3155%3B Plants - 1501%3B Viruses - 2%3B Other Eukaryotes - 2370 (source: NCBI BLink).;conf_rating=****;Dbxref=PMID:16495307,gene:2102201,UniProt:Q8LGE3
