Chr3	Araport11	gene	17935256	17940792	.	+	.	ID=AT3G48430;Name=AT3G48430;Note=relative of early flowering 6;curator_summary=Relative of Early Flowering 6 (REF6) encodes a Jumonji N/C and zinc finger domain-containing protein that acts as a positive regulator of flowering in an FLC-dependent pathway. REF6 mutants have hyperacetylation of histone H4 at the FLC locus. REF6 interacts with BES1 in a Y2H assay and in vitro. REF6 may play a role in brassinoteroid signaling by affecting histone methylation in the promoters of BR-responsive genes. It is most closely related to the JHDM3 subfamily of JmjN/C proteins.;symbol=REF6;Alias=JMJ12,Jumonji domain-containing protein 12;full_name=relative of early flowering 6;computational_description=relative of early flowering 6 (REF6)%3B FUNCTIONS IN: sequence-specific DNA binding transcription factor activity%2C zinc ion binding%2C nucleic acid binding%3B INVOLVED IN: in 6 processes%3B LOCATED IN: nucleus%3B EXPRESSED IN: 8 plant structures%3B CONTAINS InterPro DOMAIN/s: Transcription factor jumonji/aspartyl beta-hydroxylase (InterPro:IPR003347)%2C Zinc finger%2C C2H2-like (InterPro:IPR015880)%2C Transcription factor jumonji (InterPro:IPR013129)%2C Zinc finger%2C C2H2-type (InterPro:IPR007087)%2C Transcription factor jumonji%2C JmjN (InterPro:IPR003349)%2C Zinc finger%2C C2H2-type/integrase%2C DNA-binding (InterPro:IPR013087)%3B BEST Arabidopsis thaliana protein match is: Zinc finger (C2H2 type) family protein / transcription factor jumonji (jmj) family protein (TAIR:AT5G04240.1)%3B Has 105567 Blast hits to 35250 proteins in 1010 species: Archae - 0%3B Bacteria - 23%3B Metazoa - 99094%3B Fungi - 2247%3B Plants - 673%3B Viruses - 7%3B Other Eukaryotes - 3523 (source: NCBI BLink).;Dbxref=PMID:15377760,PMID:15778459,PMID:18467490,PMID:20711170,PMID:21642989,PMID:23313553,PMID:25105952,locus:504955644;locus_type=protein_coding
