Chr3	Araport11	gene	19494369	19496147	.	-	.	ID=AT3G52560;Name=AT3G52560;Note=ubiquitin E2 variant 1D-4;curator_summary=MMZ4/UEV1D encodes a protein that may play a role in DNA damage responses and error-free post-replicative DNA repair by participating in lysine-63-based polyubiquitination reactions. UEV1D can form diubiquitin and triubiquitin chains in combination with UBC13A/UBC35 in vitro. It can also functionally complement an mms2 mutation in budding yeast%2C both by increasing mms2 mutant viability in the presence of the DNA damaging agent MMS%2C and by reducing the rate of spontaneous DNA mutation. It can also rescue an mms2 ubc13 double mutant in yeast in combination with UBC13A. MMZ4/UEV1D transcripts are found in most plant organs%2C like the other three MMZ/UEV1 family members%2C but it is normally present at higher levels. In addition%2C MMZ4/UEV1D is the only family member whose transcripts are detected in pollen. However%2C MMZ4/UEV1D transcript levels do not appear to be stress-inducible. uev1d-1 mutants are more sensitive than wild type plants to the DNA damaging agent MMS in seed germination and pollen germination assays.;symbol=UEV1D-4;Alias=MMZ4,MMS2 ZWEI HOMOLOGUE 4,UEV1D,UBIQUITIN E2 VARIANT 1D;full_name=ubiquitin E2 variant 1D-4;computational_description=ubiquitin E2 variant 1D-4 (UEV1D-4)%3B CONTAINS InterPro DOMAIN/s: Ubiquitin-conjugating enzyme/RWD-like (InterPro:IPR016135)%2C Ubiquitin-conjugating enzyme%2C E2 (InterPro:IPR000608)%3B BEST Arabidopsis thaliana protein match is: MMS ZWEI homologue 3 (TAIR:AT2G36060.1)%3B Has 2665 Blast hits to 2665 proteins in 275 species: Archae - 0%3B Bacteria - 0%3B Metazoa - 1316%3B Fungi - 370%3B Plants - 595%3B Viruses - 0%3B Other Eukaryotes - 384 (source: NCBI BLink).;Dbxref=PMID:11590065,PMID:16400686,PMID:17586653,PMID:18178771,PMID:18650403,PMID:18775970,locus:2079984;locus_type=protein_coding
