Chr3	Araport11	gene	20038670	20041210	.	+	.	ID=AT3G54110;Name=AT3G54110;Note=plant uncoupling mitochondrial protein 1;curator_summary=Member of Uncoupling protein PUMP2 family. Encodes a mitochondrial uncoupling protein AtUCP1 involved in maintain the redox poise of the mitochondrial electron transport chain to facilitate photosynthetic metabolism.  Disruption of UCP1 results in a photosynthetic phenotype. Specifically there is a restriction in photorespiration with a decrease in the rate of oxidation of photorespiratory glycine in the mitochondrion. This change leads to an associated reduced photosynthetic carbon assimilation rate.;symbol=PUMP1;Alias=ATPUMP1,ARABIDOPSIS THALIANA PLANT UNCOUPLING MITOCHONDRIAL PROTEIN 1,ATUCP1,ARABIDOPSIS THALIANA UNCOUPLING PROTEIN 1,UCP,UCP1,UNCOUPLING PROTEIN 1;full_name=plant uncoupling mitochondrial protein 1;computational_description=plant uncoupling mitochondrial protein 1 (PUMP1)%3B FUNCTIONS IN: oxidative phosphorylation uncoupler activity%2C binding%3B INVOLVED IN: transport%2C photosynthesis%2C photorespiration%3B LOCATED IN: mitochondrion%2C mitochondrial inner membrane%2C plasma membrane%2C chloroplast%3B EXPRESSED IN: 26 plant structures%3B EXPRESSED DURING: 15 growth stages%3B CONTAINS InterPro DOMAIN/s: Mitochondrial substrate carrier (InterPro:IPR001993)%2C Mitochondrial brown fat uncoupling protein (InterPro:IPR002030)%2C Mitochondrial substrate/solute carrier (InterPro:IPR018108)%3B BEST Arabidopsis thaliana protein match is: uncoupling protein 2 (TAIR:AT5G58970.1)%3B Has 26567 Blast hits to 13376 proteins in 459 species: Archae - 0%3B Bacteria - 2%3B Metazoa - 11203%3B Fungi - 7876%3B Plants - 4909%3B Viruses - 3%3B Other Eukaryotes - 2574 (source: NCBI BLink).;Dbxref=PMID:9662458,PMID:11105092,PMID:11334880,PMID:11566183,PMID:13678271,PMID:14671022,PMID:15333756,PMID:16473895,PMID:17148605,PMID:17980348,PMID:18507803,PMID:16027974,PMID:19567377,PMID:19875678,PMID:21301941,PMID:21912606,PMID:23201478,PMID:2479956