Chr3	Araport11	gene	22244169	22247976	.	-	.	ID=AT3G60190;Name=AT3G60190;Note=DYNAMIN-like 1E;curator_summary=At3g60190 encodes Arabidopsis dynamin-related protein 1E%2C DRP1E%2C also known as EDR3%2C ADL4 and ADL1E%2C which is 624 amino acid residues long%2C has a predicted mass of 69.8 kDa and a pI of 7.5.  Dynamin-related protein 1E belongs to a plant-specific subclass of dynamin-related proteins (DRP1)%2C consisting of five members in Arabidopsis (A%2C B%2C C%2C D%2C E). This class is characterized by having an N-terminal GTPase domain%2C a central %E2%80%98dynamin 2%E2%80%98 domain and a C-terminal GTPase effector domain (GED)%2C a typical structure for plant dynamin-related proteins. However%2C this class lacks a PH domain and a proline-rich domain%2C which are found in classical animal dynamin-like proteins. Based on work on animal dynamins%2C the plant DRP1 proteins should be able to form polymeric structures that wrap around membranes to facilitate membrane tubulation and pinching off of vesicles%2C processes that are essential to vesicle trafficking and membrane compartmentalization.  The edr3 mutation causes a P77L substitution in the G2 motif of the GTPase domain of DRP1E.  edr3 mutant Arabidopsis plants display enhanced cell death in response to powdery mildew infection.;symbol=DL1E;Alias=ADL1E,DYNAMIN-like 1E,ADL4,ARABIDOPSIS DYNAMIN-LIKE 4,ADLP2,DYNAMIN-LIKE PROTEIN 2,DRP1E,DYNAMIN-RELATED PROTEIN 1E,EDR3,ENHANCED DISEASE RESISTANCE 3;full_name=DYNAMIN-like 1E;computational_description=DYNAMIN-like 1E (DL1E)%3B FUNCTIONS IN: GTP binding%2C GTPase activity%3B INVOLVED IN: response to cadmium ion%2C vesicle-mediated transport%2C defense response to fungus%3B LOCATED IN: mitochondrion%2C plasma membrane%2C vacuole%3B EXPRESSED IN: 24 plant structures%3B EXPRESSED DURING: 13 growth stages%3B CONTAINS InterPro DOMAIN/s: Dynamin GTPase effector (InterPro:IPR003130)%2C Dynamin%2C GTPase domain (InterPro:IPR001401)%2C Dynamin%2C GTPase region%2C conserved site (InterPro:IPR019762)%2C GTPase effector domain%2C GED (InterPro:IPR020850)%2C Dynamin central region (InterPro:IPR000375)%3B BEST Arabidopsis thaliana protein match is: DYNAMIN-like 1D (TAIR:AT2G44590.3)%3B Has 2915 Blast hits to 2753 proteins in 324 species: Archae - 2%3B Bacteria - 53%3B Metazoa - 1058%3B Fungi - 869%3B Plants - 577%3B Viruses - 0%3B Other Eukaryotes - 356 (source: NCBI BLink).;Dbxref=PMID:11351070,PMID:14750516,PMID:16618929,PMID:16824181,PMID:18650403,PMID:18809930,locus:2101482;locus_type=protein_coding
Chr3	Araport11	mRNA	22244169	22247976	.	-	.	ID=AT3G60190.1;Parent=AT3G60190;Name=AT3G60190.1;Note=DYNAMIN-like 1E;curator_summary=At3g60190 encodes Arabidopsis dynamin-related protein 1E%2C DRP1E%2C also known as EDR3%2C ADL4 and ADL1E%2C which is 624 amino acid residues long%2C has a predicted mass of 69.8 kDa and a pI of 7.5.  Dynamin-related protein 1E belongs to a plant-specific subclass of dynamin-related proteins (DRP1)%2C consisting of five members in Arabidopsis (A%2C B%2C C%2C D%2C E). This class is characterized by having an N-terminal GTPase domain%2C a central %E2%80%98dynamin 2%E2%80%98 domain and a C-terminal GTPase effector domain (GED)%2C a typical structure for plant dynamin-related proteins. However%2C this class lacks a PH domain and a proline-rich domain%2C which are found in classical animal dynamin-like proteins. Based on work on animal dynamins%2C the plant DRP1 proteins should be able to form polymeric structures that wrap around membranes to facilitate membrane tubulation and pinching off of vesicles%2C processes that are essential to vesicle trafficking and membrane compartmentalization.  The edr3 mutation causes a P77L substitution in the G2 motif of the GTPase domain of DRP1E.  edr3 mutant Arabidopsis plants display enhanced cell death in response to powdery mildew infection.;conf_class=2;symbol=DL1E;Alias=ADL1E,DYNAMIN-like 1E,ADL4,ARABIDOPSIS DYNAMIN-LIKE 4,ADLP2,DYNAMIN-LIKE PROTEIN 2,DRP1E,DYNAMIN-RELATED PROTEIN 1E,EDR3,ENHANCED DISEASE RESISTANCE 3;full_name=DYNAMIN-like 1E;computational_description=DYNAMIN-like 1E (DL1E)%3B FUNCTIONS IN: GTP binding%2C GTPase activity%3B INVOLVED IN: response to cadmium ion%2C vesicle-mediated transport%2C defense response to fungus%3B LOCATED IN: mitochondrion%2C plasma membrane%2C vacuole%3B EXPRESSED IN: 24 plant structures%3B EXPRESSED DURING: 13 growth stages%3B CONTAINS InterPro DOMAIN/s: Dynamin GTPase effector (InterPro:IPR003130)%2C Dynamin%2C GTPase domain (InterPro:IPR001401)%2C Dynamin%